{"id":"consciente","lemma":"consciente","pos":"adj","rank":1875,"glosses":["aware, cognizant","conscious","mindful"],"ipa":"/konsˈθjente/","forms":{"femininePlural":"conscientes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ea/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-consciente.wav","examples":[{"text":"Soy consciente de ello.","en":"I'm aware of it.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/441813"},{"text":"Somos conscientes del problema.","en":"We're aware of the problem.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/611825"},{"text":"Soy consciente de eso.","en":"I'm aware of that.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443604"},{"text":"Somos conscientes de la situación.","en":"We're aware of the situation.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/515235"},{"text":"Era consciente de eso.","en":"I was aware of that fact.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/69370"}]}